invariant: INV-16
file: handshake_flight.c
catches: quic_loop_host
reason: the client's hybrid secret, ML-KEM decapsulation and the x25519 half,
  runs under WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED whatever its ch_cfg.cpu states. The secret
  is the same. test/quic_loop_widemul.h runs the webpki client, which
  selects the hybrid, and requires a client whose ch_cfg.cpu holds
  CH_CPU_CONSTANT_TIME_MULTIPLY to call no file under its own names.

--- old
    uint8_t widemul = widemul_answer(&h->t->cfg);
--- new
    uint8_t widemul = WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED;
